+ * @brief Get the DPP onboarding type from UCI.
+ *
+ * Reads 'option onboardingtype' from /etc/config/prplmesh.
+ * Only meaningful in Multi-AP-Agent mode; ignored in Controller/Gateway modes.
+ *
+ * @return "DPP" if DPP wired/wireless extender path is active, "WSC" otherwise.
